# Code owners for biject (meta repo).
#
# Mirrors the ownership table in CLAUDE.md §2 — keep the two in step.
#
# `@bijectai/eng` is a placeholder until the org's real teams exist. Replace the
# handles when they do; do not delete the file. An unresolvable owner silently
# stops review from being requested, which looks exactly like "nobody had notes".

*                       @bijectai/eng

# The deployment topology. Every change to this file is a deploy — there is no
# application code in this repo, so a diff here is a statement about what will
# be running in production.
/docker-compose.yml     @bijectai/eng
/.env.example           @bijectai/eng

# The tooling that keeps pins immutable and honest.
/scripts/               @bijectai/eng
/.github/               @bijectai/eng

# The rules themselves. A diff that weakens a review rule should never be
# reviewable by fewer people than the code the rule protects.
/CLAUDE.md              @bijectai/eng
/AGENTS.md              @bijectai/eng
